WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:01.800
Matthew 8

00:01.800 --> 00:06.480
When he came down from the mountain, great crowds followed him.

00:06.700 --> 00:09.860
And behold, a leper came to him and knelt before him, saying,

00:10.720 --> 00:14.840
Lord, if you will, you can make me clean.

00:15.440 --> 00:18.940
And Jesus stretched out his hand and touched him, saying,

00:19.780 --> 00:21.560
I will be clean.

00:22.100 --> 00:25.060
And immediately his leprosy was cleansed.

00:25.500 --> 00:27.100
And Jesus said to him,

00:27.660 --> 00:29.600
See that you say nothing to anyone.

00:30.160 --> 00:34.040
But go, show yourself to the priests and offer the gift that Moses commanded,

00:34.580 --> 00:35.600
for a proof to them.

00:36.880 --> 00:41.340
When he entered Capernaum, a centurion came forward to him, appealing to him,

00:42.120 --> 00:46.900
Lord, my servant is lying paralyzed at home, suffering terribly.

00:47.360 --> 00:48.780
And he said to him,

00:49.360 --> 00:50.960
I will come and heal him.

00:51.620 --> 00:53.260
But the centurion replied,

00:54.040 --> 00:57.360
Lord, I am not worthy to have you come under my roof,

00:57.700 --> 00:59.060
but only say the word,

00:59.380 --> 00:59.980
and my servant,

01:00.000 --> 01:00.740
will be healed.

01:01.220 --> 01:03.620
For I, too, am a man under authority,

01:03.920 --> 01:05.140
with soldiers under me.

01:05.500 --> 01:06.460
And I say to one,

01:06.560 --> 01:07.880
Go, and he goes.

01:08.200 --> 01:08.860
And to another,

01:09.000 --> 01:10.580
Come, and he comes.

01:10.920 --> 01:11.840
And to my servant,

01:11.960 --> 01:13.820
Do this, and he does it.

01:14.200 --> 01:15.720
When Jesus heard this,

01:15.880 --> 01:18.300
he marveled and said to those who followed him,

01:18.940 --> 01:20.300
Truly I tell you,

01:20.540 --> 01:23.520
with no one in Israel have I found such faith.

01:24.360 --> 01:25.180
I tell you,

01:25.560 --> 01:27.540
many will come from east and west

01:27.540 --> 01:29.460
and recline at table with Abraham,

01:29.680 --> 01:29.980
Isaac,

01:30.120 --> 01:30.560
and Jacob,

01:30.920 --> 01:32.040
in the kingdom of heaven,

01:32.580 --> 01:34.000
while the sons of the kingdom

01:34.000 --> 01:35.900
will be thrown into the outer darkness.

01:36.620 --> 01:38.660
In that place there will be weeping

01:38.660 --> 01:40.080
and gnashing of teeth.

01:40.880 --> 01:42.960
And to the centurion Jesus said,

01:43.780 --> 01:47.160
Go, let it be done for you as you have believed.

01:47.760 --> 01:51.220
And the servant was healed at that very moment.

01:51.820 --> 01:53.720
And when Jesus entered Peter's house,

01:53.720 --> 01:57.020
he saw his mother-in-law lying sick with a fever.

01:57.400 --> 01:58.580
He touched her hand,

01:59.060 --> 01:59.960
and the fever left,

02:00.540 --> 02:03.020
and she rose and began to serve him.

02:03.840 --> 02:05.600
That evening they brought to him

02:05.600 --> 02:07.420
many who were oppressed by demons,

02:07.700 --> 02:09.800
and he cast out the spirits with a word,

02:10.020 --> 02:11.480
and healed all who were sick.

02:12.200 --> 02:15.420
This was to fulfill what was spoken by the prophet Isaiah.

02:16.220 --> 02:19.440
He took our illnesses and bore our diseases.

02:21.260 --> 02:23.600
Now when Jesus saw a crowd around him,

02:23.600 --> 02:26.020
he gave orders to go over to the other side.

02:26.520 --> 02:28.520
And a scribe came up and said to him,

02:29.020 --> 02:29.660
Teacher,

02:30.000 --> 02:32.740
I will follow you wherever you go.

02:33.420 --> 02:34.960
And Jesus said to him,

02:35.760 --> 02:36.880
Foxes have holes,

02:37.260 --> 02:38.880
and birds of the air have nests,

02:39.420 --> 02:42.260
but the Son of Man has nowhere to lay his head.

02:43.040 --> 02:44.900
Another of the disciples said to him,

02:45.640 --> 02:48.080
Lord, let me first go and bury my father.

02:48.780 --> 02:50.020
And Jesus said to him,

02:50.640 --> 02:51.820
Follow me,

02:52.060 --> 02:54.760
and leave the dead to bury their own dead.

02:56.460 --> 02:58.120
And when he got into the boat,

02:58.220 --> 02:59.380
his disciples followed him.

03:00.000 --> 03:02.460
Behold, there arose a great storm on the sea,

03:02.580 --> 03:04.980
so that the boat was being swamped by the waves.

03:05.340 --> 03:06.300
But he was asleep.

03:06.820 --> 03:08.620
And they went and woke him, saying,

03:09.420 --> 03:11.720
Save us, Lord, we are perishing.

03:12.580 --> 03:13.840
And he said to them,

03:14.700 --> 03:18.040
Why are you afraid, O you of little faith?

03:18.840 --> 03:22.500
Then he rose and rebuked the winds and the sea.

03:23.280 --> 03:25.280
And there was a great calm.

03:26.120 --> 03:28.800
And the men marveled, saying,

03:29.120 --> 03:29.840
What?

03:29.840 --> 03:31.340
What sort of man is this,

03:31.620 --> 03:33.720
that even winds and sea obey him?

03:34.380 --> 03:36.020
And when he came to the other side,

03:36.360 --> 03:37.760
to the country of the Gadarenes,

03:38.100 --> 03:40.160
two demon-possessed men met him,

03:40.280 --> 03:41.500
coming out of the tombs,

03:41.700 --> 03:44.540
so fierce that no one could pass that way.

03:45.020 --> 03:46.460
And behold, they cried out,

03:47.240 --> 03:51.340
What have you to do with us, O Son of God?

03:51.700 --> 03:55.980
Have you come here to torment us before the time?

03:56.420 --> 03:59.100
Now a herd of many pigs was feeding

03:59.100 --> 03:59.820
at some distance,

03:59.960 --> 04:02.460
and the demons begged him, saying,

04:03.220 --> 04:08.880
If you cast us out, send us away into the herd of pigs.

04:09.580 --> 04:11.120
And he said to them,

04:11.900 --> 04:12.400
Go.

04:13.260 --> 04:15.680
So they came out and went into the pigs,

04:15.800 --> 04:18.900
and behold, the whole herd rushed down the steep bank

04:18.900 --> 04:20.880
into the sea and drowned in the waters.

04:21.580 --> 04:23.960
The herdsmen fled, and going into the city,

04:24.040 --> 04:25.020
they told everything,

04:25.400 --> 04:27.880
especially what had happened to the demon-possessed men.

04:27.880 --> 04:29.020
And behold,

04:29.020 --> 04:31.300
all the city came out to meet Jesus,

04:31.300 --> 04:32.580
and when they saw him,

04:32.920 --> 04:34.600
they begged him to leave their region.

